---
const nav = [['About','about'],['Projects','projects'],['Research','research'],['Open Source','open-source']];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f7f5" />
  <meta name="description" content="OpenSource Lab — building useful technology in the open." />
  <title>OpenSource Lab</title>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="header">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="OpenSource Lab home">
      <img src="/osl-logo.svg" alt="" />
      <span>OpenSource Lab</span>
    </a>
    <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
      {nav.map(([label, id]) => <a href={`#${id}`}>{label}</a>)}
    </nav>
    <a class="contact-link" href="#contact">Contact <span>↗</span></a>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-watermark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/osl-logo.svg" alt="" /></div>
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">OPEN TECHNOLOGY · RESEARCH · ENGINEERING</p>
        <h1>Build useful<br /><em>things.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">OpenSource Lab is an independent technology space focused on thoughtful software, practical research and open collaboration.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button dark" href="#projects">Explore our work <span>↗</span></a>
          <a class="button light" href="#about">About the lab</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mark-line one"></div>
        <div class="mark-line two"></div>
        <div class="mark-line three"></div>
        <img src="/osl-logo.svg" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="hero-bottom"><span>OPEN SOURCE LAB</span><span>INDIA · 2026</span></div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="section about">
      <div class="label">01 / ABOUT</div>
      <div class="two-column">
        <h2>Technology should be<br /><span>clear, useful and open.</span></h2>
        <div class="body-copy">
          <p>We create software, tools and experiments that solve real problems. The approach is simple: understand the problem, build carefully, document the work and share what can help others.</p>
          <p>Small ideas are welcome. Difficult problems are welcome too.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="projects" class="section projects">
      <div class="label">02 / PROJECTS</div>
      <div class="section-intro">
        <h2>Selected work.</h2>
        <p>A focused collection of tools, prototypes and reusable systems.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="project-list">
        <a class="project" href="#contact">
          <span class="number">01</span>
          <div><h3>Open Tools</h3><p>Practical utilities that make technical work simpler.</p></div>
          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="project" href="#contact">
          <span class="number">02</span>
          <div><h3>Research Prototypes</h3><p>Experiments across software, data, automation and interaction.</p></div>
          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="project" href="#contact">
          <span class="number">03</span>
          <div><h3>Open Systems</h3><p>Reusable foundations designed to help the next idea move faster.</p></div>
          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="research" class="section research">
      <div class="label">03 / RESEARCH</div>
      <div class="research-grid">
        <div><h2>Explore.<br /><em>Test.</em><br />Learn.</h2></div>
        <div class="body-copy research-copy">
          <p>We investigate interesting technical problems through prototypes and experiments. The goal is not complexity for its own sake — it is to discover what works and make the useful parts accessible.</p>
          <div class="research-rule"></div>
          <p class="small">Software · Data · Automation · Interfaces</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="open-source" class="section open-source">
      <div class="label">04 / OPEN SOURCE</div>
      <div class="two-column">
        <h2>Make it.<br /><span>Share it.</span></h2>
        <div class="body-copy">
          <p>Open source is part of how we work. When something can be useful beyond the lab, we publish it so others can inspect it, improve it and build on it.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/opensourcelab-official" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Visit OpenSource Lab on GitHub <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="section contact">
      <div class="label">05 / CONTACT</div>
      <div class="contact-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">HAVE SOMETHING WORTH BUILDING?</p>
        <h2>Let's make it<br /><em>real.</em></h2>
        <a class="email" href="mailto:hello@opensourcelab.in">hello@opensourcelab.in <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-brand"><img src="/osl-logo.svg" alt="" /> <span>OpenSource Lab</span></div>
    <span>© 2026</span>
    <a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a>
  </footer>

  <style>
    :global(*){box-sizing:border-box}
    :global(html){scroll-behavior:smooth}
    :global(body){margin:0;background:#f7f7f5;color:#171817;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;overflow-x:hidden}
    :global(body::selection){background:#171817;color:#fff}
    a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
    .header{height:74px;padding:0 5vw;position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:20;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(23,24,23,.09);background:rgba(247,247,245,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(18px)}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em}.brand img{width:29px;height:29px;object-fit:contain}
    nav{display:flex;gap:32px}nav a,.contact-link{font-size:12px;color:#626560;transition:color .2s}nav a:hover,.contact-link:hover{color:#171817}.contact-link span{margin-left:8px}
    .hero{min-height:100vh;padding:150px 7vw 70px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;align-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(23,24,23,.09)}
    .hero-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:790px}.eyebrow,.label{font:10px/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#858883}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(72px,9.5vw,150px);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.075em;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 30px}.hero h1 em,.research h2 em,.contact h2 em{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-weight:400;color:#8a8d88}.lead{max-width:570px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#60635f}.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:32px;flex-wrap:wrap}.button{padding:13px 18px;border:1px solid #d4d5d1;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s}.button:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:#999}.button.dark{background:#171817;color:#fff;border-color:#171817}.button.light{background:transparent}.button span{margin-left:12px}.hero-mark{height:470px;width:470px;justify-self:end;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center}.hero-mark:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:62%;height:62%;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(244,108,25,.13),transparent 66%)}.hero-mark img{width:145px;position:relative;z-index:3;filter:drop-shadow(0 15px 35px rgba(20,25,22,.12))}.mark-line{position:absolute;inset:4%;border:1px solid rgba(23,24,23,.11);border-radius:50%}.mark-line.one{transform:rotate(22deg) scaleY(.38)}.mark-line.two{transform:rotate(-37deg) scaleY(.55)}.mark-line.three{transform:rotate(78deg) scaleY(.38)}.hero-watermark{position:absolute;right:-14%;bottom:-18%;width:58vw;max-width:850px;opacity:.025;transform:rotate(-8deg)}.hero-watermark img{width:100%}.hero-bottom{position:absolute;bottom:28px;left:7vw;right:7vw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:9px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#9a9c98}
    .section{padding:140px 9vw;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(23,24,23,.09)}.label{margin-bottom:65px}.two-column{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;gap:10vw}.two-column h2,.section-intro h2{font-size:clamp(55px,7.3vw,112px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.065em;font-weight:550;margin:0}.two-column h2 span{color:#999c97}.body-copy{max-width:470px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#626560}.body-copy p{margin:0 0 24px}
    .projects{background:#fff}.section-intro{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:50px;margin-bottom:70px}.section-intro p{max-width:310px;margin:0;color:#737671;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}.project-list{border-top:1px solid #dcded9}.project{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px 1fr 40px;gap:25px;align-items:center;padding:32px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dcded9;transition:padding .25s}.project:hover{padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px}.number{font:10px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#969994}.project h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-weight:550}.project p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#7a7d78}.arrow{font-size:20px;text-align:right;color:#777a75}
    .research{background:#171817;color:#f4f4f1}.research .label{color:#8e918c}.research-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:10vw;align-items:end}.research h2{font-size:clamp(72px,9vw,140px);line-height:.83;letter-spacing:-.075em;font-weight:550;margin:0}.research-copy{color:#b5b7b2;padding-bottom:10px}.research-rule{height:1px;background:#3d3f3b;margin:45px 0 22px}.research-copy .small{font:10px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#898c87}
    .open-source{background:#f7f7f5}.text-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #9c9f9a;padding-bottom:8px;font-size:13px}.text-link span{margin-left:10px}.contact{min-height:90vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.contact-inner{text-align:center;margin:auto}.contact h2{font-size:clamp(78px,10vw,155px);line-height:.84;letter-spacing:-.075em;font-weight:550;margin:20px 0 45px}.email{font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,28px);border-bottom:1px solid #b3b5b0;padding-bottom:9px}.email span{margin-left:12px}
    footer{padding:25px 5vw;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid rgba(23,24,23,.09);font-size:11px;color:#858883}.footer-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:#343632;font-weight:600}.footer-brand img{width:22px;height:22px}.footer-brand span{font-size:12px}footer a:hover{color:#171817}
    @media(max-width:900px){.header{padding:0 20px}.header nav{display:none}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:125px 22px 85px}.hero-mark{position:absolute;width:330px;height:330px;right:-95px;bottom:65px;opacity:.55}.hero-mark img{width:95px}.hero-copy{max-width:700px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(68px,18vw,110px)}.lead{font-size:16px;max-width:520px}.hero-bottom{left:22px;right:22px}.section{padding:105px 22px}.label{margin-bottom:48px}.two-column,.research-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px}.two-column h2,.section-intro h2{font-size:clamp(54px,15vw,92px)}.section-intro{display:block}.section-intro p{margin-top:24px}.project{grid-template-columns:40px 1fr 25px;gap:15px}.project h3{font-size:21px}.project p{line-height:1.5}.research h2{font-size:clamp(68px,18vw,110px)}.contact h2{font-size:clamp(70px,18vw,115px)}footer{padding:24px 22px;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}}
    @media(max-width:520px){.contact-link{display:none}.hero-mark{width:280px;height:280px;right:-100px;bottom:70px}.hero-bottom span:last-child{display:none}.button{width:100%;text-align:center}.project{padding:25px 0}.project:hover{padding-left:0;padding-right:0}}
  </style>
</body>
</html>
